stateDiagram-v2
    state "Power on" as PowerOn
    state "Self-test" as SelfTest
    state "❓ Jammed" as Jammed
    [*] --> PowerOn
    PowerOn --> SelfTest : power-on
    SelfTest --> Locked : self-test passed
    SelfTest --> Fault : self-test failed
    Locked --> Opening : allow / release lock, start motor
    Locked --> Locked : deny or no answer in 2 s
    Opening --> Open : fully open / stop motor
    Open --> Closing : after 10 s
    Closing --> Locked : fully closed / engage lock
    Opening --> Jammed : jam sensor
    Closing --> Jammed : jam sensor
    Fault --> PowerOn : power-on restart
    note right of Jammed
        The text says the jam sensor reports a blocked door,
        but not what the controller does then.
    end note
    class PowerOn role_start
    class Fault role_error
    class Jammed role_suggestion
